error[L0520]: the result of `greeter` keeps a borrow of a temporary
 --> check/returned_closure_keeps_temporary_string.knv:5:24
  |
1 | (defn greeter (name)
  |                ---- the returned closure keeps this borrow of `name`
...
5 |   (let (greet (greeter (str "ana")))
  |                        ^^^^^^^^^^^ this temporary is dropped at the end of the statement
  |
  = help: bind the argument with `let` before the statement that binds the result, so it lives as long as the result
  = note: run `knave doc L0520` for an explanation
